8594;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>NaOI</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CHI</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p>The number of carbon atoms present in the product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "13b279", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f992ee0e063d92a6d4c"}, {"id": "e0d315", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f992ee0e063d92a6d4d"}, {"id": "92d395", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f992ee0e063d92a6d4e"}, {"id": "19398f", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f992ee0e063d92a6d4f"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f992ee0e063d92a6d50", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60ced5dd19d2aa2b78a3a78c"], "topics": ["60e40fd6f1ef260f84ed1ea3"], "concepts": ["60e56768499d1e49588f8eea"], "question": {"text": "<p>An athlete is given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of glucose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> for energy. This is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math> of energy. The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of this energy gained is utilized by the athlete for sports activities at the event. In order to avoid storage of energy, the weight of extra water he would need to perspire is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_____g</mi></math> (Nearest integer) Assume that there is no other way of consuming stored energy.</p><p>Given : The enthalpy of evaporation of water is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Molar mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> are $12.1$ and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "19c8bc", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f992ee0e063d92a6d51"}, {"id": "87aaf9", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f992ee0e063d92a6d52"}, {"id": "b4ae0b", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f992ee0e063d92a6d53"}, {"id": "0b6fc4", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f992ee0e063d92a6d54"}], "questionLabels": []}], "markingScheme": {"_id": "608283c623cf4b3ad8f125e5", "title": "JEE Numerical", "correctAttempt": 4, "incorrectAttempt": -1, "createdAt": "2021-04-09T08:45:27.797Z", "updatedAt": "2021-07-05T05:39:27.056Z", "__v": 0, "updated_by": "6042252509c5bf34e8a2f178"}, "maximumAttemptLimit": 5, "linkedQuestions": [], "createdAt": "2026-04-14T14:30:49.877Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-14T14:30:49.877Z", "__v": 0}, "position": 1, "_id": "69de4f992ee0e063d92a6d5b"}], "bonusSections": [], "packDetails": [], "paidFeatures": [], "tags": [], "timeRestrictionSlots": [], "createdAt": "2026-04-14T11:16:11.179Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T04:58:05.935Z", "testType": "PYQs as Chapter Tests", "isResumeBufferAllowed": true, "enableAccessibility": true, "maxAttemptableQuestion": 25, "analysisVideoThumbnail": "", "analysisVideoThumbnailDark": "", "shortTitle": "", "subjectDetails": [{"subjectId": "607018ee404ae53194e73d91", "title": "Chemistry", "shortName": "Chem"}], "testTimerType": "mm", "isMarkForReviewAvailable": true}, "temporaryTestDetail": {"_id": "6a4a1f0c9cbf3c6513068549", "testId": "69de21fb7e39d99b57bc5bab", "userId": "6914cc9c4d7566258ee3a8fd", "st